[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u9055\uFF5E\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u5929\u624D\u306F\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\uFF01\n\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2\u30FB\u30D5\u30A9\u30F3\u30FB\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u30A6\u30A7\u30D0\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027ve got it all wrong! The genius here is me!\nIlmeria Von Leinweber!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u3092\u3068\u304D\u3081\u304F\u3001\u8D85\u4E00\u6D41\u306E\u5929\u624D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m the brilliant alchemist who\u0027s all the rage right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5929\u624D\u306A\u306E\u306F\u3053\u306E\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u3063\uFF01\n\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u30FB\u30DF\u30B9\u30C8\u30EB\u30FC\u30C8\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I\u0027m the genius!\nFiris Mistlud!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u3092\u3068\u304D\u3081\u304F\u3001\u8D85\u4E00\u6D41\u306E\u5929\u624D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m the brilliant alchemist who\u0027s all the rage right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u771F\u4F3C\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I told you to stop copying me~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u306B\u306A\u306B\uFF1F\u3000\u4F55\u304B\u697D\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u601D\u3044\u51FA\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3057\u3066\u305F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What\u0027s this? Remembering something fun?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\u3001\u3042\u3041\u2026\u2026\u3002\u3046\u3093\uFF01\n\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u524D\u306B\u821E\u53F0\u3067\u62AB\u9732\u3057\u305F\u6642\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3068\u304B\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, um... Yeah!\nJust thinking about that time Ilmeria and I performed on stage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3075\u3075\u3001\u3042\u308C\u306F\u6B74\u53F2\u306B\u6B8B\u308B\u3053\u3068\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306A\u3057\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308F\u3002\n\u6700\u521D\u306F\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u5E83\u5834\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u307E\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4ECA\u3067\u306F\u5927\u821E\u53F0\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, that was definitely one for the history books.\nStarting from that small plaza, and now look at you on the big stage..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3067\u3082\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u3069\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3002\n\u3000\u308F\u305F\u3057\u304C\u6700\u521D\u306F\u30A4\u30BF\u30BA\u30E9\u3067\u771F\u4F3C\u3063\u3053\u3057\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But I wonder how Ilmeria really felt about it.\nAt first I was just copying her as a joke...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u308C\u3067\u6C17\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\u3089\u30D5\u30A1\u30F3\u304C\u3067\u304D\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u4ECA\u3058\u3083\u3059\u3063\u304B\u308A\u4EBA\u6C17\u306E\u82B8\u4EBA\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Then before I knew it, we had fans,\nand now everyone calls us popular performers...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u3046\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\n\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3055\u304C\u5408\u308F\u3055\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3082\u3046\u2026\u2026\u3063\u3066\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...and when you add Firis\u0027s cuteness to the mix, it\u0027s just... Hey, what\u0027s wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30EA\u30A2\u59C9\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u3055\u3002\n\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u5ACC\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3063\u3066\u3001\u601D\u3046\u306E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sis Lia, I think... maybe Ilmeria\nreally hated it all along..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5ACC\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u82B8\u3092\u62AB\u9732\u3059\u308B\u306E\u304C\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hated it...?\nPerforming together with you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3082\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3057\u3001\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3068\u4E26\u3079\u3089\u308C\u3066\n\u82B8\u4EBA\u3055\u3093\u3063\u3066\u5468\u308A\u304B\u3089\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That, and being called a performer\nby everyone alongside me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5ACC\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3046\u3002\n\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3082\u3046\u3042\u3042\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3059\u308B\u306E\u306F\u3084\u3081\u3088\u3046\u304B\u306A\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think she probably didn\u0027t like it.\nSo I\u0027m thinking of stopping all that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u305F\u516C\u8A8D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u5236\u5EA6\u3082\u3001\n\u629C\u3051\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3046\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I\u0027m thinking of leaving the Licensed Alchemist system\nthat Ilmeria talked about too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u8A66\u9A13\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3044\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\n\u305D\u308C\u3060\u3051\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u4FA1\u5024\u304C\u9AD8\u307E\u308B\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But isn\u0027t having the exam a good thing?\nIt raises the value of being an alchemist."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3046\u3088\uFF1F\u3000\u8A66\u9A13\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3059\u3063\u3054\u304F\n\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3089\u4ECA\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3057\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think so too! I worked really hard for that exam,\nand that\u0027s why I am where I am now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306D\u3001\u3053\u3063\u3061\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u306F\u307E\u3060\u3044\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3002\n\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3089\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9\u3055\u3093\u304C\u8003\u3048\u308B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3057\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I don\u0027t think this world needs it yet.\nIf it becomes necessary, I\u0027m sure Brad will think of something..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u2026\u2026\u3002\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3042\u4ECA\u5EA6\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u4F1A\u3046\u6642\u306B\n\u304D\u3063\u3071\u308A\u4F1D\u3048\u308B\u306E\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... So you\u0027re going to tell Ilmeria\nall this directly next time?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u3053\u308C\u4EE5\u4E0A\u3001\u8FF7\u60D1\u306F\u304B\u3051\u305F\u304F\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I don\u0027t want to cause any more trouble."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3063\u304B\u3041\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306D\u3047\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3002\n\u79C1\u306F\u30E2\u30CE\u30DE\u30CD\u3092\u3057\u3066\u305F\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u5927\u597D\u304D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hey Firis.\nI love the cute Firis who did those impersonations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3001\u3046\u3093\u3002\u305A\u3063\u3068\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3063\u3066\n\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u305F\u3082\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah. You were always saying how cute I was..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3042\u308A\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\n\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3082\u5927\u597D\u304D\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, I love the natural Firis too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u8F9B\u304F\u3066\u3001\u60A9\u3093\u3067\u3001\n\u60B2\u3057\u3044\u601D\u3044\u3092\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3068\u3001\u79C1\u3082\u60B2\u3057\u3044\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But when Firis is hurting, troubled,\nand feeling sad, it makes me sad too..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u3001\u30EA\u30A2\u59C9\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u3093\u304B\u76EE\u304C\u6016\u3044\u3088\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-Sis Lia? Your eyes are kind of scary..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\uFF01\u3000\u305D\u306E\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u8863\u88C5\u306F\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\n\u7740\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u306E\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But! I still want you to keep wearing\nthat cute outfit!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
